>`. Previously code-server\r\n  failed with `listen EEXIST` or `Server has no address`.\r\n- The cookie domain was not being set against the shared root host of proxy\r\n  domains when proxy domains contained template variables like `{{port}}`,\r\n  resulting in having to sign in multiple times per domain instead of only once\r\n  as originally intended.\r\n- When doing the web socket origin check, if the host does not already contain a\r\n  port, fall back to `X-Forwarded-Port`.\r\n- Fix default ports not matching in the web socket origin check (for example\r\n  `https://coder.com` will now match `https://coder.com:443`).\r\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/coder/code-server/releases/tag/v4.144.0"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/config","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true"],"exposed_ports":["8443/tcp"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/code-server/builds/4.144.0-ls6.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/code-server/builds/4.144.0-ls6/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/code-server/builds/4.144.0-ls6/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/code-server/builds/4.144.0-ls6/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-code-server/releases/tag/4.144.0-ls6","pages":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-code-server/builds/4.144.0-ls6/","files":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-code-server/builds/4.144.0-ls6/files.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-code-server/builds/4.144.0-ls6/files.arm64.json.g